      {
         "id": "c",
         "prompt": "Let \\( g(x) = x f(x) \\). Use the line tangent to the graph of \\( g \\) at \\( x = 2 \\) to approximate \\( g(1.9) \\).",
         "setup_required": false,
         "answer_latex": "g(1.9) \\approx 8.9",
         "worked_solution": [
            {
               "text": "Product rule at x = 2.",
               "latex": "g'(2) = f(2) + 2f'(2) = 5 + 6 = 11"
            },
            {
               "text": "Tangent line through (2, g(2)) = (2, 10).",
               "latex": "y = 10 + 11(x - 2)"
            },
            {
               "text": "Evaluate at x = 1.9.",
